# Implementation Plan - Taskwarrior WebUI Enhancement

## Architecture & Tech Stack
- **Target Fork**: https://github.com/pplupo/taskwarrior-webui
- **Backend**: Node.js, Koa.js, TypeScript, taskwarrior-lib CLI wrapper.
- **Frontend**: Vue 2 (Composition API), Nuxt.js, Vuetify (Material Design), Vuex (typed-vuex).

## Proposed Architectural Modules

### 1. Backend Extensions (`backend/src/`)
- `GET /api/tasks/active`: Query active task status.
- `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/start` & `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/stop`: Direct timer management.
- `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate` & `DELETE /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate`: Annotation management.
- `POST /api/tasks/undo` & `GET /api/tasks/undo/preview`: Undo operations preview and execution.
- `GET /api/config/queries`: Custom queries loader.
- `GET /api/reports/burndown` & `GET /api/reports/projects`: Progress metrics.

### 2. Frontend Components & Store (`frontend/`)
- Store additions: `activeTask`, `customQueries`, `undoPreview`, `activeViewMode`, `mnemonicsMap`.
- Keyboard & Mnemonic Engine (`plugins/hotkeys.ts`): Shortcut handlers (`Ctrl+Shift+K`, `n`, `t`, `q`, `u`, `s`) with visual red-box overlays.
- Kanban View (`components/KanbanBoard.vue`, `components/KanbanCard.vue`): 4-column drag-and-drop layout (To Do, In Progress, Waiting, Done).
- Widgets (`components/ActiveTaskBar.vue`, `components/UndoDialog.vue`, `components/CustomQueryBar.vue`, `components/ReportsView.vue`).

## Verification Strategy
- Backend API integration testing for timer and undo endpoints.
- Component rendering tests for Kanban board drag-and-drop.
- E2E keyboard shortcut validation.
